.TH "libnvmf_tid_dup" 9 "libnvmf_tid_dup" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
libnvmf_tid_dup \- Allocate a copy of an existing TID.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "struct libnvmf_tid *" libnvmf_tid_dup
.BI "(const struct libnvmf_tid *tid "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "tid" 12
Source TID, or NULL.
.SH "RETURN"
Allocated copy, or NULL if \fItid\fP is NULL or on allocation failure.
